# Keep the working tree LF-only so Prettier/ESLint results are stable on Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite files to CRLF on checkout).
* text=auto eol=lf

cheat-engine/www/cheat/libs/*         linguist-vendored
cheat-engine/www/cheat/css/*          linguist-vendored
cheat-engine/www/cheat/css/main.css  -linguist-vendored
